  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-02a632fb-cfbe-4cb1-89e0-989e1490d857\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-b33fc2a0-9bef-427d-b8d7-9fe687debf12\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-1eb66887-586d-4849-b805-6f5d9d858e6b\">이 글은 아무도 보지 않았으면 좋겠다. 그러면서 동시에 너무 말하고 싶다.  그래서 제목을  .  이라고 써봤다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-44a7230c-76ec-48be-a3ba-9bbbb62084af\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-be97c7bb-513a-4009-b313-5a928914a4f8\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-8b337115-1206-4b0b-bd14-3999791e5ff9\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-cf8eb973-e1ac-4d8d-80e0-a37d952d9e2f\">이 글은 너무 노력했는데, 잘 안되서 속상한 마음에 쓰는 글이다. 어른이 되면, 나의 부족한 부분을 드러내는게 무서워진다. 화살로 돌아올수 있다는걸 알아버려서. 하지만 그래도 드러내고 싶다. 부족한 사람이니깐. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-07f2651a-9107-4b34-9e1e-b0fad73d2026\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-0924cce4-097c-4061-837a-74d77b4df27c\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-6e14679c-9bde-45b7-9d72-3ee64925ea22\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-a36f4845-a1b5-4350-857b-508ccf86d150\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-af42f6d1-29a7-4d48-bad3-b05e61537395\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-a8f7fd88-f2cc-493e-8703-34483a8c0f82\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-fd40bba9-50d5-447a-9156-b588d70de79c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-8509e4c2-95c7-4366-8292-762dcbd7fc60\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-9e4d6493-44ee-4357-b832-470a912fe6e0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-52ed9129-ce81-4276-8d01-5ca60d0485ab\">어릴적 엄마한테 이런 말을 한적이 있다. &quot;엄마 나는 빨리 어른이 되고 싶어. 공부 안하고 친구들이랑 놀러갈 수 있잖아&quot; 엄마는 말했다.  &quot;그게 행복인게 얼마나 좋은건데&quot;</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-9369ee29-ead4-4669-bcd6-898118b4ef9e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-aa09fc18-1b4c-4479-8dd7-dedecbd88caf\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-e4614ce5-cfc8-461b-80cd-bc85b1db2754\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-595a77fa-07df-4ff8-974d-74a045a9f564\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-bf8efa7a-e188-4c47-a743-68528e2e419b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-1f1a2b63-baec-412f-8ed9-170ca2f6ea2f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-34c47119-912c-4bb7-89a9-ddd671258f89\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-3ef96da1-a453-4811-a251-de7861766fc1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-0b89ca5d-bc5f-422f-9fc9-bd318185c635\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-27451ce9-4573-4ce5-b1af-4257366bd914\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-53f2ef2a-8d44-4170-b124-8982d7bb3f0d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-d6c49945-3f75-4215-a1fb-5ca578ccc735\">찰나의 순간에 느껴졌다. &#x27;어른이 된다는건 쉽지 않구나&#x27; 그래도 공부를 안해도 된다는 소리인줄 알고, 빨리 어른이 되고 싶었다. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-110b1c3c-5ba9-4e5d-a8fd-5d803f385eb4\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-69330bf5-aa59-4255-a372-695b7587ad42\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-dfac66f4-8e7b-418a-8846-5b0fcebac86e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-627aed09-d9af-4369-88ad-a09cc706c4a1\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-17a866a5-2450-430e-8fd9-2a5adc45eb92\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-ff257675-1ef0-4020-a3c7-0fc5e6e66f38\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-a138de6d-f521-4399-bd8d-09fbc1600f14\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-87e00379-785c-4fcb-b2ec-4a61549dc594\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-57b0207c-db30-4c5a-a56e-dc40100b4924\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-b4d01b6a-25a4-4878-9342-4bfbab157896\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-ed70e730-80ea-4ee9-94ac-c69018aecf73\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-b44cc945-005c-4148-b173-91f04b391a43\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-101a7b1e-207f-4e4e-896d-db656a75e65f\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-1f8d100d-dbe2-4dfc-a799-783354449c86\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.8;\" id=\"SE-e17f3896-6601-489c-9bee-6d7bc2cdeed3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs15 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-43eb12d8-9408-474c-b2ca-de7231621ed7\">노력으로 안되는게 있다는걸. </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT 